    "text": "The number of points, at which the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is not differentiable, is"
